            "review_title": "Review at Minami Pub 1",
            "review_text": "Marcus Maximus C\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nAwesome Place!\nOct 2018\nAwesome place with very friendly and japanese speaking staff! It’s a Japanese counter bar with a lot of lady staff with a dream of one day running their own business. A lot of the Japanese friends that I met here have one thing to say : If you are away from home and working in HCM, Minami is the best home away from home because everyone here is giving each other the best feeling for relax, inspiration and motivation in whatever we are pursuing in our careers.. Some of my clients from Malaysia, Singapore and South Korea literally fall I love with this place . And keeps asking me to come back again to have a drink.. haha.. they are in love! Wish everyone to give it a try..;) Awesome!\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-13",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
